2564
01:28:18,740 --> 01:28:19,530
-Listen, you guys.

2565
01:28:19,530 --> 01:28:22,440
I promise I won't do any
 more cop and doughnut jokes,

2566
01:28:22,440 --> 01:28:24,960
but I'm not gonna sign
 this silly piece of paper.

2567
01:28:24,960 --> 01:28:27,300
-Oh, really, Joel, it's for your
 own protection as well as ours.

2568
01:28:27,300 --> 01:28:29,770
-OK, well, uh, you guys
 got to sign it too.

2569
01:28:29,770 --> 01:28:30,850
-All right, fair enough.

2570
01:28:30,850 --> 01:28:32,470
Now read it aloud.

2571
01:28:32,470 --> 01:28:33,820
-OK, uh.

2572
01:28:33,820 --> 01:28:36,770
Uh, "I, state your name."

2573
01:28:36,770 --> 01:28:38,200
-(IN UNISON) "I,
 state your name."

2574
01:28:38,200 --> 01:28:39,340
-Oh, you guys, now cut it out!

2575
01:28:39,340 --> 01:28:41,220
That's just as bad as
 doing doughnut jokes!

2576
01:28:41,220 --> 01:28:42,100
-Sorry!
 Sorry, sorry, sorry.

2577
01:28:42,100 --> 01:28:42,410
-Sorry, sorry, sorry.

2578
01:28:42,410 --> 01:28:43,320
-Sorry, sorry, sorry.
 -It's my fault.

2579
01:28:43,320 --> 01:28:44,060
-OK.

2580
01:28:44,060 --> 01:28:48,430
I'll read it by myself, then.
 "Whereas I hereby warrant that

2581
01:28:48,430 --> 01:28:51,310
I will cease and desist
 all jokes, quips,

2582
01:28:51,310 --> 01:28:54,510
humorous anecdotes, bon mots,
 and other devices of repartee

2583
01:28:54,510 --> 01:28:57,350
pertaining to, exclusively
 and in general,

2584
01:28:57,350 --> 01:29:01,150
all references and observations,
 direct or indirect,

2585
01:29:01,150 --> 01:29:03,720
pertaining to, but
 not exclusively,

2586
01:29:03,720 --> 01:29:07,520
in description of law
 enforcement officials who

2587
01:29:07,520 --> 01:29:12,410
ingest, solicit, consume, or
 hoard those pastries which can

2588
01:29:12,410 --> 01:29:15,650
be described under the
 terms of the "code-i-cile"--

2589
01:29:15,650 --> 01:29:16,480
-Codicil.

2590
01:29:16,480 --> 01:29:19,800
-"Codicil below as belonging
 to a nonspecific group,

2591
01:29:19,800 --> 01:29:21,780
except in the common
 parlance, as doughnuts

2592
01:29:21,780 --> 01:29:25,500
and doughnut-related pastries
 heretofore known as doughnuts."

2593
01:29:25,500 --> 01:29:27,740
-Uh, there's an exemption
 for FBI agents and muffins

2594
01:29:27,740 --> 01:29:28,240
in the codicil.

2595
01:29:28,240 --> 01:29:29,820
-Yeah, we thought we
 could be flexible on that.

2596
01:29:29,820 --> 01:29:30,320
But keep going.

2597
01:29:30,320 --> 01:29:33,960
-"This being enacted on this day
 and enforced in "perpetu-ity"--

2598
01:29:33,960 --> 01:29:34,630
-Perpetuity.

2599
01:29:34,630 --> 01:29:36,420
-"Perpetuity throughout
 the universe,

2600
01:29:36,420 --> 01:29:39,870
we hereunto set our hand
 and seal on the day above

2601
01:29:39,870 --> 01:29:41,970
mentioned--" OK, I guess
 I can live with that.

2602
01:29:41,970 --> 01:29:42,470
-OK.

2603
01:29:42,470 --> 01:29:43,680
-All right, good.

2604
01:29:43,680 --> 01:29:44,560
-All right.

2605
01:29:44,560 --> 01:29:45,790
-I'll have Gypsy
 notarize this later.

2606
01:29:45,790 --> 01:29:46,420
-Gypsy's a notary?

2607
01:29:46,420 --> 01:29:46,920
-Mhm.

2608
01:29:46,920 --> 01:29:48,030
Stamp it, please.

2609
01:29:48,030 --> 01:29:48,530
OK.

2610
01:29:48,530 --> 01:29:50,970
You know, the little
 friends are right, folks.

2611
01:29:50,970 --> 01:29:52,790
Let's put an end to
 the hackneyed practice

2612
01:29:52,790 --> 01:29:54,550
of cop and doughnut jokes.

2613
01:29:54,550 --> 01:29:55,850
Thank you, won't you?

2614
01:29:55,850 --> 01:29:57,490
What do you think, sirs?

2615
01:29:57,490 --> 01:29:58,970
-Boy, isn't that the truth.

2616
01:29:58,970 --> 01:30:01,480
You know, boys, I don't
 even like doughnuts.

2617
01:30:01,480 --> 01:30:03,110
I'm not saying I won't
 eat them if they're there.

2618
01:30:03,110 --> 01:30:04,450
-Hey, tell them about
 the Chinese food.

2619
01:30:04,450 --> 01:30:04,950
-That's right.

2620
01:30:04,950 --> 01:30:06,080
Today we had Chinese food.

2621
01:30:06,080 --> 01:30:07,650
-Moo goo gai pan,
 and it was terrific.

2622
01:30:07,650 --> 01:30:09,420
And, you know, we're
 not all Irish, either.

2623
01:30:09,420 --> 01:30:11,940
-Well, Kevin here is
 Irish, but me, I'm Danish.

2624
01:30:11,940 --> 01:30:14,310
-[LAUGHS_LOUDLY]

2625
01:30:14,310 --> 01:30:15,320
-I don't like you.

2626
01:30:15,320 --> 01:30:16,110
-Hey, cool, man.

2627
01:30:16,110 --> 01:30:18,360
And you know the thing
 about the flat feet?

2628
01:30:18,360 --> 01:30:20,130
I got arches the size
 of the monkey house

2629
01:30:20,130 --> 01:30:21,700
at the Brookfield Zoo.

2630
01:30:21,700 --> 01:30:22,790
And I've got this bunion.

2631
01:30:22,790 --> 01:30:24,690
Have you seen the size of this
 sucker on the side of my--

2632
01:30:24,690 --> 01:30:26,450
-Thanks for sharing, guys.

2633
01:30:26,450 --> 01:30:27,530
Can we help you?

2634
01:30:27,530 --> 01:30:29,830
-Uh, yes sir, as a matter
 of fact, you can, um.

2635
01:30:29,830 --> 01:30:31,670
You can show a little
 respect for your neighbors

2636
01:30:31,670 --> 01:30:33,930
by keeping the music
 down, and, uh, next time,

2637
01:30:33,930 --> 01:30:34,850
you'll avoid a citation.

2638
01:30:34,850 --> 01:30:36,340
Just sign right
 there on the bottom.

2639
01:30:36,340 --> 01:30:37,190
-It's these rock walls.

2640
01:30:37,190 --> 01:30:38,690
The sound goes
 right through them.

2641
01:30:38,690 --> 01:30:40,860
You know, if I had my way,
 I'd outlaw these sub-woofers.

2642
01:30:40,860 --> 01:30:41,550
-That's right.

2643
01:30:41,550 --> 01:30:43,750
Hey, do us all a
 favor next time,

2644
01:30:43,750 --> 01:30:44,770
and think of others first.

2645
01:30:44,770 --> 01:30:45,280
Will ya?

2646
01:30:45,280 --> 01:30:46,670
OK?

2647
01:30:46,670 --> 01:30:47,590
Have a good day.

2648
01:30:47,590 --> 01:30:49,710
-Oh, uh, thank you, uh--

2649
01:30:49,710 --> 01:30:51,860
-Until next time, Joel.

2650
01:30:51,860 --> 01:30:53,840
Push the button, Frank.

2651
01:30:53,840 --> 01:30:55,300
-Can I see your gun?

2652
01:30:55,300 --> 01:30:56,580
-(WARNING) Frank!

2653
01:30:56,580 --> 01:30:57,410
[CHUCKLES]

2654
01:30:57,410 --> 01:31:00,060
-By the way, was that
 your car out front?

2655
01:31:00,060 --> 01:32:10,400
[THEME MUSIC]

